Scope and third-party notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT license above covers only the original scripts (flash.bat,
Enable_ReBAR_Windows.bat, Enable_ReBAR_Windows.ps1) and the documentation.

The firmware images contain third-party components that are NOT covered by
this license and remain the property of their respective owners, including:
UEFI/BIOS modules (American Megatrends, Huananzhi), Intel Management Engine
firmware and CPU microcode (Intel), Secure Boot certificates (Microsoft, AMI),
and community modifications (ser8989 S3TurboHack, xCuri0 ReBarUEFI/ReBarDxe,
Koshak1013). The Intel Flash Programming Tool in tools/ is Intel software.

Flashing firmware can render hardware unbootable. Use at your own risk and
always keep a verified backup.
